---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { SITE } from '@/data/site';
---

<BaseLayout title="About" description="About Jasper Jiarui Lou: computer science, machine learning, optimization, and agent systems.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="shell page-hero__grid">
      <div data-reveal><p class="eyebrow">About</p><h1>Understand the theory.<br />Build the system.</h1></div>
      <aside class="page-hero__aside" data-reveal><p>CS student at CUHK-Shenzhen · Interested in machine learning, optimization, probability, and agent systems.</p></aside>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="about-page">
    <div class="shell about-grid">
      <div data-reveal><h2>Jasper Jiarui Lou<br />娄家瑞</h2></div>
      <div class="about-copy" data-reveal>
        <p>I study Computer Science at The Chinese University of Hong Kong, Shenzhen. My current research direction centers on machine learning, with optimization, probability, and mathematical foundations as tools for understanding models and algorithms more deeply.</p>
        <p>I also build systems that make research questions concrete. CUHKSZ MicroWorld is a 3D campus-based agent environment for navigation, time-aware planning, transport decisions, replanning, and reproducible evaluation. Holistic Assistant is a long-running academic planning system that turns curriculum documents, SIS course data, and structured rules into editable plans and grounded guidance.</p>
        <p>Other engineering work includes read-only market intelligence and cross-device AI-state infrastructure. Across these projects, I care about explicit evidence, reproducibility, failure modes, and keeping model-generated output separate from deterministic system state.</p>
        <p>For research, projects, or collaboration, email me at <a href={`mailto:${SITE.email}`}>{SITE.email}</a>. Public code and repositories are available on <a href={SITE.github} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
